{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2020-02", "window": 4, "start_date": 1582502400, "end_date": 1583020799, "month_true_total": 390, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:53:41 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "64320766", "author": {"steamid": "76561198416444145", "personaname": "TonyHJY", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198416444145/", "num_games_owned": 229, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 17349, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 42, "playtime_at_review": 3038, "last_played": 1788011455, "avatar": "b93f04b9194fba8980a2dc74947d47d0087ba113"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "强力推荐！\n除了新手教程的第一关外，所有的任务都是和两个舍友一起打的。这个游戏对分工配合设计的很不错，每个职业的特色缺陷都一清二楚：清小怪和清障迅速的钻机手，强大持续火力和能部属绳索的枪手，所有职业里唯一一个能创造地形的托比昂（不是）以及表面上是电灯实际上是对boss宝具的挖矿蜘蛛侠侦察兵。当四种职业聚在一起时就是一支强大的队伍。强烈建议找固定的小伙伴组四人队。不过就算你没有朋友也别担心，打开服务器列表可以找到很多的房间，因为这游戏的标点系统堪比apex，所以即使是路人局也能配合默契。\n游戏的肝度也设置的很不错，除了看脸出的超频核心以外，材料和钱都不难攒。难度也设计的很合理，除了五级极度吃配合默契以外，其他的也不难过关，不过稍微放松一点也可能会被大自爆带走全队。\n", "timestamp_created": 1583012349, "timestamp_updated": 1583012349, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.552102386951446533", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "64316657", "author": {"steamid": "76561198104693318", "personaname": "GoosE", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198104693318/", "num_games_owned": 135, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 116277, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 95904, "last_played": 1783166581, "avatar": "d8ac0577a65e9eb8a61fffa3f3f2921832826b5b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "霍克斯Ⅳ星，我的赛博故乡。", "timestamp_created": 1583006154, "timestamp_updated": 1727407800, "voted_up": true, "votes_